WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:41.941 --> 01:47.096
=Episode 14=
(The Untouchable Lover)

01:58.901 --> 01:59.901
Luzhou.

02:00.421 --> 02:01.421
Luzhou.

02:03.461 --> 02:04.342
Don't you feel

02:04.342 --> 02:06.220
the taste of this place's food
is just average?

02:06.580 --> 02:08.660
Why do so many people still come here?

02:10.100 --> 02:11.861
A movie had some scenes
filmed here before.

02:12.580 --> 02:13.301
What movie?

02:13.580 --> 02:14.580
What is it about?

02:15.220 --> 02:16.220
Want to know?

02:17.140 --> 02:18.140
Another 800?

02:18.740 --> 02:19.781
This time, in euros.

02:23.060 --> 02:24.861
Are you not afraid of draining me?

02:25.260 --> 02:26.660
Getting addicted to extorting me.

02:27.301 --> 02:28.301
You're heartless.

02:28.941 --> 02:29.941
No pay?

02:30.660 --> 02:31.700
Then ask others.

02:38.821 --> 02:39.821
Excuse me.

02:42.501 --> 02:43.220
Kid,

02:43.461 --> 02:44.461
what do you want to know?

02:44.461 --> 02:45.461
I will tell you.

02:46.941 --> 02:48.021
You are also Chinese?

02:49.180 --> 02:50.700
Many Chinese people come here to eat.

02:50.821 --> 02:52.381
Such eye-catching ones are rare.

02:52.781 --> 02:53.821
The brother is handsome.

02:53.821 --> 02:54.821
The younger one is cute.

02:56.060 --> 02:58.060
My cute little brother
has many questions.

02:58.981 --> 03:00.140
Please answer them for him.

03:00.700 --> 03:02.100
Come find me outside later.

03:02.100 --> 03:03.100
I'll be at the door.

03:05.821 --> 03:06.821
Thank you.

03:08.180 --> 03:09.220
What do you want to know?

03:10.140 --> 03:11.140
Don't mind him.

03:11.220 --> 03:12.220
He ended a relationship.

03:14.540 --> 03:15.540
Luzhou, wait for me.

03:17.821 --> 03:18.821
Wait for me.

03:20.821 --> 03:22.540
They told us to go to the Lego store.

03:22.981 --> 03:23.501
Is that okay?

03:23.620 --> 03:24.620
Okay.

03:25.301 --> 03:26.620
It's not that I'm picking on him.

03:26.620 --> 03:28.180
You know, it's rare for us to go out.

03:28.180 --> 03:29.501
Is it so hard to take a picture?

03:29.740 --> 03:30.740
Are you alright?

03:31.021 --> 03:31.672
I'm fine.

03:31.901 --> 03:33.260
Luzhou has been in a bad mood.

03:33.260 --> 03:34.260
You know that.

03:34.821 --> 03:36.821
What's there to be
in a bad mood about for him?

03:36.821 --> 03:38.421
We are seeing him off to school.

03:38.421 --> 03:39.342
He should be happy.

03:39.342 --> 03:40.421
Always pulling a long face.

03:40.421 --> 03:41.421
All right.

03:41.580 --> 03:42.781
You are his dad.

03:42.781 --> 03:44.301
Can you stop arguing with the child?

03:47.901 --> 03:49.220
Was that an explosion just now?

04:09.461 --> 04:10.461
Someone is injured.

04:12.260 --> 04:13.301
From the restaurant.

04:14.700 --> 04:15.700
Luzhou.

04:15.781 --> 04:16.341
Xingqi.

04:16.341 --> 04:17.021
Wait. Slow down.

04:17.021 --> 04:18.021
Luzhou.

04:18.220 --> 04:19.220
Slow down.

04:19.341 --> 04:20.341
Come on.

04:20.660 --> 04:21.660
Let me see.

04:22.821 --> 04:24.140
Be careful.

04:28.312 --> 04:28.901
Hello.

04:28.901 --> 04:29.901
Hello, Luzhou.

04:30.220 --> 04:31.320
Luzhou, where are you?

04:31.700 --> 04:32.821
How's the situation?

04:32.821 --> 04:33.660
Yes, how is it?

04:33.660 --> 04:34.660
Chen Xingqi is fine.

04:34.861 --> 04:35.941
No, he got hit and injured.

04:36.821 --> 04:37.661
What about you?

04:37.661 --> 04:39.341
How are you? Are you okay?

04:41.540 --> 04:42.620
Hello, Luzhou.

04:42.840 --> 04:43.421
What's wrong?

04:43.421 --> 04:44.421
Hello, Luzhou.

04:44.941 --> 04:45.941
No sound.

04:46.140 --> 04:46.781
Stay here.

04:46.981 --> 04:47.981
Stay here.

04:48.100 --> 04:49.100
Luzhou.

05:08.021 --> 05:09.528
(Police Line)

05:21.060 --> 05:22.022
(According to reports,)

05:22.022 --> 05:24.180
(a local explosion occurred in Ruicheng)

05:24.180 --> 05:25.180
(on the 17th.)

05:25.381 --> 05:28.140
(Currently, one person
has died and three have been injured.)

05:28.381 --> 05:31.220
(News Report)
(A Chinese national student hurt.)

05:31.740 --> 05:34.341
(After the incident,
the police reached the scene)

05:34.341 --> 05:35.540
(and began their probe.)

05:35.540 --> 05:37.021
(Human causes aren't ruled out.)

05:37.620 --> 05:38.620
Fruit is here.

05:39.700 --> 05:40.700
What are you doing?

05:45.557 --> 05:49.240
(News Report)

05:56.660 --> 05:57.381
Over there.

05:57.620 --> 05:58.620
Xingqi.

05:59.060 --> 05:59.580
Xingqi.

05:59.580 --> 06:01.260
Excuse me, they are my sons. My sons.

06:01.260 --> 06:02.260
Hurry up.

06:02.620 --> 06:04.260
Luzhou, are you okay?

06:04.461 --> 06:04.981
Xingqi.

06:04.981 --> 06:05.540
Are you okay?

06:05.656 --> 06:06.180
I'm fine.

06:06.180 --> 06:06.680
What hurts?

06:06.680 --> 06:07.540
A bit startled.

06:07.540 --> 06:08.100
Are you okay?

06:08.100 --> 06:08.700
What's wrong?

06:08.700 --> 06:09.700
His hand got scratched.

06:09.861 --> 06:10.941
Are you okay, Xingqi?

06:11.301 --> 06:12.301
Here, please.

06:12.501 --> 06:13.220
Xingqi,

06:13.301 --> 06:13.861
are you okay?

06:13.861 --> 06:14.861
It's okay, I'm here.

06:16.220 --> 06:17.220
Are you okay?

06:17.784 --> 06:18.700
To the hospital.

06:19.100 --> 06:20.100
- Okay.
- Okay.

06:20.421 --> 06:21.821
Did you bring the passport?

06:22.100 --> 06:24.140
I-It's in the hotel.

06:24.140 --> 06:24.740
I'll go get it.

06:24.901 --> 06:25.901
Be careful yourself.

06:26.700 --> 06:27.740
Hurry up.

06:27.740 --> 06:28.740
It's okay.

06:29.060 --> 06:30.381
Xingqi, I'm here.

06:30.740 --> 06:31.740
Don't be afraid.

07:43.660 --> 07:44.502
What's wrong, Zhi?

07:44.502 --> 07:46.140
Has Chen Luzhou connected you today?

07:46.461 --> 07:48.060
He hasn't replied to my message all day.

07:48.060 --> 07:49.220
I don't know where he's gone.

07:49.421 --> 07:50.341
What? You want him?

07:50.341 --> 07:51.341
Then I'll hang up.

07:53.205 --> 07:58.072
(Ruicheng Explosion Accident)

08:40.060 --> 08:41.060
Chen Luzhou?

08:45.661 --> 08:46.661
Looking for me?

08:50.180 --> 08:51.661
Why didn't you answer the phone?

08:54.180 --> 08:55.420
I dropped the phone.

08:56.741 --> 08:57.741
I couldn't answer it.

08:59.021 --> 09:00.021
Are you okay?

09:00.781 --> 09:01.781
I'm okay.

09:04.741 --> 09:06.741
Don't worry. I won't die.

09:08.220 --> 09:08.862
I promise you

09:08.862 --> 09:10.420
I'd play the violin for you at 80.

09:15.941 --> 09:17.100
Have you missed me?

09:30.741 --> 09:31.781
You're really bad at this.

09:31.981 --> 09:33.420
You should say it's okay,

09:33.621 --> 09:35.340
when we broke up, you said,

09:35.781 --> 09:37.661
"Xu Zhi, your shoelace is untied."

09:37.981 --> 09:38.981
How arrogant.

09:42.220 --> 09:43.220
Not as arrogant as you.

09:45.901 --> 09:47.300
Then why don't you ask me?

09:49.500 --> 09:50.500
What?

09:52.140 --> 09:53.661
Ask if I've missed you.

09:56.500 --> 09:57.500
Have you?

09:59.420 --> 10:00.821
I'll tell you next time.

10:04.060 --> 10:05.060
Okay.

10:50.340 --> 10:51.340
Xingqi.

10:54.621 --> 10:55.621
Luzhou.

10:56.300 --> 10:58.581
No. Luzhou!

11:19.661 --> 11:20.661
No.

11:21.220 --> 11:22.420
This matter is unacceptable.

11:22.941 --> 11:23.941
No room for discussion.

11:24.460 --> 11:25.541
Such a big matter

11:26.901 --> 11:28.781
is not up to you.

11:29.701 --> 11:31.180
You think it's easy to get in here?

11:32.060 --> 11:33.340
I've put in so much effort.

11:34.821 --> 11:36.260
What exactly are you thinking?

11:37.821 --> 11:40.021
You should also
consider from our perspective,

11:40.021 --> 11:41.021
Luzhou.

11:41.861 --> 11:42.901
No way.

11:44.460 --> 11:45.460
Besides,

11:46.180 --> 11:47.300
the arrangements

11:47.300 --> 11:48.141
are all set.

11:48.141 --> 11:49.300
Now you're not going.

11:52.981 --> 11:53.981
Why?

11:55.541 --> 11:56.741
This is my own decision.

11:58.581 --> 11:59.741
I'm not to discuss with you.

12:06.500 --> 12:08.260
Luzhou.

12:09.500 --> 12:10.661
Nice job raising your son.

12:11.100 --> 12:12.260
Look at him now.

12:14.701 --> 12:15.701
Just perfect.

12:17.621 --> 12:18.981
I'll book the flight ticket.

12:19.460 --> 12:21.340
I can't stay in this place any longer.

12:22.100 --> 12:23.621
What's gotten into you?

12:24.340 --> 12:26.060
He's losing it, you have to too?

12:26.060 --> 12:28.100
Can you calm down?

12:28.100 --> 12:30.060
Calm down.

12:30.380 --> 12:31.901
How can I calm down!

12:31.901 --> 12:34.781
- You...
- Every time I close my eyes,

12:34.781 --> 12:36.220
I see that boy covered in blood

12:36.220 --> 12:37.541
lying in front of me.

12:38.621 --> 12:40.060
He's about the same age as Luzhou.

12:40.861 --> 12:41.981
Who can guarantee

12:41.981 --> 12:43.701
similar situations won't happen again.

12:44.021 --> 12:45.380
What if it's Luzhou?

12:46.500 --> 12:48.541
Just because of an incidental event,

12:48.541 --> 12:50.100
do you need to be so emotional?

12:50.340 --> 12:51.621
If this continues like this,

12:51.621 --> 12:52.781
will he continue his studies?

12:52.781 --> 12:53.901
Luzhou is my son.

12:54.100 --> 12:55.781
His life is more important
than anything.

12:57.621 --> 12:58.661
Let's return

12:59.460 --> 13:01.140
immediately.

13:05.701 --> 13:08.100
Zhi, here's a little fortune pouch
for you.

13:09.701 --> 13:11.821
Good luck always.
You really understand me.

13:14.060 --> 13:15.060
Xu Zhi,

13:15.741 --> 13:18.661
this is a small token for you.

13:20.621 --> 13:23.541
T-This wouldn't be
a promissory note, would it?

13:24.180 --> 13:26.220
How could a promissory note
be this thick? Feel it.

13:28.941 --> 13:30.981
When did you become so generous?

13:30.981 --> 13:31.581
Exactly.

13:31.861 --> 13:32.861
Can't remember?

13:33.140 --> 13:33.942
Isn't this

13:33.942 --> 13:35.260
a promise from when you were 6?

13:35.741 --> 13:36.941
I gave you New Year's money

13:37.140 --> 13:38.140
and you said,

13:38.420 --> 13:39.621
"You give me the money,

13:39.621 --> 13:40.621
but I can't spend it.

13:40.781 --> 13:42.260
My dad takes it all."

13:42.861 --> 13:43.821
I asked you what to do.

13:43.821 --> 13:44.621
You said,

13:44.621 --> 13:45.621
"You save it for me.

13:45.701 --> 13:46.500
When I hit college,

13:46.500 --> 13:47.421
give it all to me."

13:47.421 --> 13:48.781
I'm here to fulfill that today.

13:49.861 --> 13:50.901
As expected of Zhi,

13:50.901 --> 13:52.981
having such a business mind at 6.

13:53.701 --> 13:55.220
Isn't this at least 10,000?

13:55.220 --> 13:56.220
A round number.

13:56.941 --> 13:58.741
See. I told you my lucky bag worked.

13:58.741 --> 13:59.941
Really!

14:00.380 --> 14:02.180
Don't take so much money.

14:02.380 --> 14:03.380
What if she wastes it?

14:04.581 --> 14:06.100
It's for her.

14:06.100 --> 14:08.060
Now that you've grown up,
you get to manage it.

14:08.060 --> 14:08.742
Ignore him.

14:08.742 --> 14:10.941
Yes, I'll use it wisely.

14:12.621 --> 14:14.060
But I have to add.

14:14.260 --> 14:15.340
When you earn money,

14:15.821 --> 14:18.140
first buy clothes and food for your dad.

14:18.821 --> 14:20.380
Boyfriend should come second.

14:20.621 --> 14:23.060
Dad is most important. You know?

14:24.260 --> 14:25.500
He's telling you.

14:25.621 --> 14:26.701
Dad is the most important.

14:27.140 --> 14:29.260
Then I might as well not date
or marry in the future.

14:29.260 --> 14:30.420
Just stay by your side.

14:30.420 --> 14:31.420
Don't find me annoying.

14:31.661 --> 14:32.861
How could you not date?

14:33.060 --> 14:33.942
I'm telling you.

14:33.942 --> 14:35.781
Once you're in college
and enter society,

14:35.781 --> 14:36.781
you'll know.

14:36.981 --> 14:38.460
The most innocent romance

14:38.821 --> 14:39.981
is just in the campus.

14:40.500 --> 14:41.741
You should still

14:41.741 --> 14:42.741
give it a try.

14:42.741 --> 14:43.380
Alright.

14:43.621 --> 14:45.060
Don't chase my boyfriend around

14:45.060 --> 14:46.901
with a knife.

14:46.901 --> 14:48.100
How come?

14:48.460 --> 14:50.260
You'd be better off without Chen Luzhou.

14:50.541 --> 14:51.861
Check it at the Hua University.

14:52.100 --> 14:53.180
What if among ten guys,

14:53.180 --> 14:54.701
nine of them are like him?

14:55.060 --> 14:56.781
Just don't get tired of them.

14:56.981 --> 14:58.701
Okay, I'll take your good words.

14:59.861 --> 15:01.180
Love is love.

15:01.380 --> 15:02.460
If someone bullies you,

15:02.661 --> 15:04.180
remember to tell me immediately.

15:04.781 --> 15:05.781
Okay.

15:06.701 --> 15:07.701
The car is here.

15:07.781 --> 15:08.301
Hurry.

15:08.301 --> 15:09.340
So soon?

15:09.340 --> 15:10.341
Don't miss the train.

15:10.341 --> 15:12.300
- Really.
- Zhi.

15:14.100 --> 15:16.460
Zhi, this time you really have
to take care of yourself.

15:16.941 --> 15:18.180
Wear more when it gets cold.

15:19.661 --> 15:21.060
Mr. Xu, are you finished?

15:22.100 --> 15:24.180
Zhi,
you must take good care of yourself.

15:24.180 --> 15:25.500
Make a video call every day.

15:25.500 --> 15:26.581
Call me daily.

15:26.781 --> 15:27.622
Don't lose weight.

15:27.622 --> 15:28.741
You must stay chubby.

15:28.741 --> 15:30.140
- Got it?
- Got it.

15:30.140 --> 15:30.741
Miss me.

15:30.821 --> 15:31.861
You need to study well.

15:32.741 --> 15:34.180
You've never been away from me

15:34.180 --> 15:35.180
for so long.

15:35.768 --> 15:36.300
Alright.

15:36.300 --> 15:36.861
Don't go.

15:37.021 --> 15:38.021
That's enough.

15:38.420 --> 15:39.741
She'll come back during holidays.

15:39.741 --> 15:40.301
Yes.

15:40.301 --> 15:41.941
Missing the train later would be bad.

15:42.541 --> 15:43.781
- Bye-bye.
- Bye-bye.

15:43.781 --> 15:44.781
Bye-bye.

15:45.260 --> 15:46.260
Wait for me.

15:46.581 --> 15:48.021
I'll go to Beijing next year.

15:48.021 --> 15:49.021
Alright.

15:50.581 --> 15:51.581
Bye-bye.

16:13.621 --> 16:18.456
(Safe travels.)

16:22.968 --> 16:24.504
♪Don't be afraid,
what you've experienced♪

16:26.060 --> 16:27.260
This is it.

16:27.870 --> 16:29.764
♪You will fulfill the past♪

16:29.982 --> 16:31.654
♪Dream you long for♪

16:31.672 --> 16:34.552
♪Open your arms to embrace the breeze♪

16:35.384 --> 16:38.520
♪Together with you♪

16:38.936 --> 16:40.632
♪Look, this city♪

16:40.632 --> 16:43.512
♪It keeps raining♪

16:43.646 --> 16:45.496
♪Ticking and tattling♪

16:45.726 --> 16:47.256
♪Who is worried♪

16:47.320 --> 16:50.488
♪I believe
you can't find a reason either♪

16:51.288 --> 16:54.808
♪Don't give it an answer♪

16:54.872 --> 16:58.203
♪I'm the same♪

16:58.203 --> 17:01.848
♪Just keep moving forward♪

17:01.944 --> 17:05.880
♪Memories fade♪

17:06.040 --> 17:09.848
♪Yet we are still♪

17:09.848 --> 17:13.956
♪For ages♪

17:52.861 --> 17:53.500
Xu Zhi?

17:53.500 --> 17:54.500
Yes.

17:56.220 --> 17:57.460
Hello, my name is Xu Gongzhu.

17:57.621 --> 17:58.621
Hello.

17:58.821 --> 17:59.621
She is Liu Yisi.

17:59.621 --> 18:00.621
We are the same major.

18:01.100 --> 18:02.300
Do you need help? I'll do it.

18:03.100 --> 18:04.100
Thank you.

18:07.861 --> 18:08.861
Thank you.

18:09.140 --> 18:10.140
No problem.

18:14.661 --> 18:15.861
You're also reading these.

18:16.701 --> 18:17.781
My friend gave them to me.

18:19.060 --> 18:20.781
Everyone who can get into Hua University

18:20.781 --> 18:22.021
is truly extraordinary.

18:23.060 --> 18:24.380
When

18:24.541 --> 18:25.461
school starts,

18:25.461 --> 18:26.981
let's go to the library together.

18:26.981 --> 18:27.512
Is it okay?

18:27.781 --> 18:28.781
Okay.

18:29.500 --> 18:30.060
Hello,

18:30.140 --> 18:31.460
I am your roommate, Du Qilan.

18:31.821 --> 18:32.821
Thank you.

18:33.180 --> 18:33.981
This is for you.

18:33.981 --> 18:34.981
Thank you.

18:35.500 --> 18:36.060
Thank you.

18:36.060 --> 18:37.060
Take some if you like.

18:37.180 --> 18:38.180
Don't be shy with Senior.

18:38.380 --> 18:39.380
Senior?

18:39.661 --> 18:40.941
Yes, she is

18:40.941 --> 18:42.140
a sophomore in philosophy.

18:42.340 --> 18:43.621
I was assigned

18:43.621 --> 18:44.901
with several seniors.

18:44.901 --> 18:46.340
After they graduated,

18:46.340 --> 18:47.340
you all came.

18:48.340 --> 18:49.340
By the way,

18:49.420 --> 18:51.060
there's a mixer.

18:51.060 --> 18:52.500
I signed you all up.

18:53.021 --> 18:55.581
Many seniors will be there.

18:55.581 --> 18:56.140
Don't be late.

18:56.500 --> 18:57.421
Senior.

18:57.421 --> 18:58.500
- Handsome guy.
- Handsome guy.

18:59.821 --> 19:00.500
Thank you.

19:00.500 --> 19:01.500
No problem.

19:02.300 --> 19:03.340
I'll leave first.

19:03.661 --> 19:05.300
Contact me anytime.

19:05.460 --> 19:06.420
Okay, bye-bye.

19:06.420 --> 19:07.460
- Bye-bye.
- Bye-bye.

19:07.460 --> 19:09.060
I'm coming. Don't rush me.

19:09.060 --> 19:09.862
Need me?

19:09.862 --> 19:11.420
No need. I can do it myself.

19:11.621 --> 19:12.621
Okay.

19:15.288 --> 19:18.392
(Basic Architectural Design)

19:18.840 --> 19:20.657
(Architectural Design Basics)

19:21.950 --> 19:24.152
(Ancient Architecture,
Tang Dynasty Architecture)

19:24.568 --> 19:26.444
(Architectural Art)

19:51.861 --> 19:53.981
(I changed my number.
Remember to save it.)

19:54.701 --> 19:55.701
(Received.)

19:56.460 --> 19:57.421
(On the first day,)

19:57.421 --> 19:58.621
(how did you all spend it?)

20:02.541 --> 20:03.541
(Making my bed.)

20:08.821 --> 20:11.260
(Did you go to Ruicheng
to change your number, Lucy?)

20:11.260 --> 20:12.340
(Why aren't you talking?)

20:12.821 --> 20:14.661
(You haven't
forgotten us already, have you?)

20:18.981 --> 20:19.981
(Silly boy,)

20:20.420 --> 20:21.460
(do you know)

20:21.460 --> 20:23.060
(what does time difference mean?)

20:29.741 --> 20:30.741
(I'm going to sleep.)

21:12.140 --> 21:13.140
Luzhou.

21:13.220 --> 21:14.781
Luzhou.

21:48.701 --> 21:49.701
Mom,

21:50.901 --> 21:52.420
how many days remain?

21:53.300 --> 21:54.541
If this continues,

21:55.060 --> 21:56.781
my hand will swell like a pig's trotter.

21:57.661 --> 21:59.140
The doctor said

21:59.661 --> 22:01.781
you won't need injections
until all your indicators

22:02.060 --> 22:03.060
are completely normal.

22:03.460 --> 22:05.500
They also said I need to rest more.

22:07.941 --> 22:08.941
Don't think about it.

22:09.420 --> 22:11.100
You have to attend art class as usual.

22:13.541 --> 22:15.100
Didn't Dad say I could skip it?

22:15.100 --> 22:16.100
Useless.

22:17.260 --> 22:18.901
I don't care. I just want to rest.

22:19.420 --> 22:20.420
I just want to rest.

22:21.260 --> 22:22.300
I want to eat ice cream.

22:23.340 --> 22:24.340
Remember?

22:24.500 --> 22:25.901
When you were in Ruicheng,

22:25.901 --> 22:27.621
you had a fever and started vomiting.

22:28.021 --> 22:29.340
Still want to eat ice cream?

22:30.180 --> 22:31.541
I don't care. I just want it.

22:31.701 --> 22:32.582
Alright, stop...

22:32.582 --> 22:33.981
Sir, turn right ahead

22:34.260 --> 22:35.260
and stop.

22:41.741 --> 22:43.380
Still macadamia, two scoops?

22:44.340 --> 22:45.340
Right.

22:59.541 --> 23:00.541
Mom,

23:01.140 --> 23:02.140
don't you think

23:02.701 --> 23:03.781
Luzhou is acting weird.

23:05.781 --> 23:06.821
If it were before,

23:07.380 --> 23:09.100
he would take
the opportunity to extort me.

23:10.220 --> 23:11.901
But this time he agreed so quickly.

23:14.500 --> 23:15.781
Your brother treats you well.

23:16.861 --> 23:17.861
Not well?

23:21.021 --> 23:22.741
I still like him the way he was before.

23:24.340 --> 23:25.781
Ever since he came back,

23:26.340 --> 23:27.901
he's not close to us anymore.

23:36.446 --> 23:41.220
(Welcome Party)

23:51.981 --> 23:52.981
Xu Zhi.

23:53.100 --> 23:54.100
Xu Zhi.

23:55.300 --> 23:56.500
Excuse me.

23:58.781 --> 24:00.260
No wonder looking familiar.

24:00.260 --> 24:01.260
It really is you.

24:02.100 --> 24:03.541
Qian's mom always mentions you.

24:03.981 --> 24:05.060
She said you're

24:05.060 --> 24:06.260
the best among Qian's tutors.

24:07.781 --> 24:08.861
Did you come alone?

24:09.260 --> 24:09.821
Xu Zhi.

24:09.981 --> 24:11.500
I'll go over first.

24:11.941 --> 24:12.941
Okay.

24:18.701 --> 24:19.701
Where are the others?

24:20.180 --> 24:21.380
Backstage. Eyeing cute guys.

24:21.380 --> 24:23.420
Next, we have philosophy sophomore,

24:23.420 --> 24:24.381
Jiang Yu,

24:24.381 --> 24:27.100
(Welcome Party and Opening Ceremony)
singing Freedom.

24:40.541 --> 24:45.080
♪Both of us lack something♪

24:47.901 --> 24:53.240
♪That's why we instantly become unhappy♪

24:53.981 --> 24:57.021
♪Simplicity is hard♪

24:57.861 --> 25:00.792
♪There are many burdens♪

25:01.460 --> 25:03.821
♪Though very brave♪

25:04.380 --> 25:08.661
♪I still feel sad♪

25:09.941 --> 25:14.460
♪In life, there are choices♪

25:17.340 --> 25:22.500
♪But wisdom often comes
after the closes♪

25:23.541 --> 25:26.741
♪My emotions are a mess♪

25:27.180 --> 25:30.340
♪My words are harsh♪

25:31.100 --> 25:33.701
♪Communication♪

25:34.541 --> 25:37.460
♪Just falls short♪

25:37.781 --> 25:40.180
♪Maybe only you♪

25:40.581 --> 25:41.701
♪Understand me♪

25:41.701 --> 25:45.300
♪So you didn't escape♪

25:45.661 --> 25:47.621
♪With tears streaming down♪

25:47.621 --> 25:49.340
♪You hold me tight♪

25:49.340 --> 25:51.300
♪Whispering softly♪

25:51.300 --> 25:53.661
♪How you love me♪

25:53.661 --> 25:54.981
♪Only you♪

25:55.260 --> 25:56.500
♪Understand me♪

25:56.500 --> 26:00.380
♪Like a trapped beast♪

26:00.460 --> 26:02.300
♪In a skyscraper♪

26:02.300 --> 26:03.300
Isn't he quite handsome?

26:03.981 --> 26:04.981
What?

26:05.420 --> 26:06.421
He's Jiang Yu.

26:06.421 --> 26:07.500
Heartthrob of Humanities.

26:07.500 --> 26:09.821
♪Maybe only you♪

26:10.180 --> 26:11.141
♪Understand me♪

26:11.141 --> 26:14.901
♪So you didn't escape♪

26:15.180 --> 26:16.941
♪With tears streaming down♪

26:16.941 --> 26:18.861
♪You hold me tight♪

26:18.861 --> 26:20.661
♪Whispering softly♪

26:20.661 --> 26:22.981
♪How you love me♪

26:29.420 --> 26:30.420
Eat what?

26:31.300 --> 26:33.741
Nothing. I'm dieting.

26:34.340 --> 26:35.460
I want to eat fried chicken.

26:35.901 --> 26:36.901
Sure.

26:58.621 --> 26:59.621
Where's she going?

26:59.741 --> 27:00.741
I don't know.

27:29.941 --> 27:30.941
Junior.

27:31.581 --> 27:32.220
What's wrong?

27:32.541 --> 27:33.901
I've lost one of my earrings.

27:35.340 --> 27:36.340
Let me help you find it.

28:07.901 --> 28:08.901
Junior!

28:13.981 --> 28:14.981
Is it this one?

28:20.781 --> 28:21.781
Thank you.

28:29.460 --> 28:30.260
Thank you.

28:30.420 --> 28:31.941
I almost thought I couldn't find it.

28:33.180 --> 28:34.781
This earring is important to you, right?

28:34.781 --> 28:35.781
That's right.

28:38.300 --> 28:39.300
My name is Jiang Yu,

28:39.741 --> 28:41.581
sophomore from School of Humanities.

28:41.941 --> 28:42.701
My name is Xu Zhi.

28:42.701 --> 28:43.340
Architecture.

28:43.500 --> 28:44.500
How did you know?

28:45.140 --> 28:45.982
When singing,

28:45.982 --> 28:47.021
I noticed you.

28:47.021 --> 28:47.500
Alright.

28:47.500 --> 28:48.500
Xu Zhi.

28:48.621 --> 28:49.621
Li Ke.

28:49.861 --> 28:51.180
You left too quickly.

28:51.180 --> 28:52.180
I forgot to tell you.

28:52.621 --> 28:54.021
I formed a group for Qingyi locals.

28:54.021 --> 28:55.220
We meet occasionally.

28:55.220 --> 28:56.060
I'll add you later.

28:56.060 --> 28:56.821
Sure.

28:57.021 --> 28:57.661
I'm there.

28:57.661 --> 28:58.661
I'm leaving. Bye-bye.

28:58.661 --> 28:59.140
Bye-bye.

28:59.140 --> 29:00.140
Bye-bye.

29:05.300 --> 29:06.701
You two are high school classmates?

29:09.021 --> 29:10.140
No, we're both from Qingyi.

29:10.140 --> 29:11.140
Different high schools.

29:11.380 --> 29:12.541
She's a friend of my friend.

29:14.220 --> 29:15.220
Girlfriend?

29:16.621 --> 29:17.901
Sort of an ex-girlfriend.

29:20.821 --> 29:21.821
I'm off now.

29:37.237 --> 29:41.336
(Huaguang University's
Extra Admissions Plan)

29:46.821 --> 29:49.260
(Luzhou, you're about to be outed.)

29:57.581 --> 30:00.220
(There's a charming guy chasing Xu Zhi.)

30:00.500 --> 30:01.621
(You better be careful now.)

30:02.100 --> 30:04.140
(Even though I think you're
more handsome than him.)

30:04.140 --> 30:05.500
(But, maybe Xu Zhi)

30:05.500 --> 30:06.500
(doesn't think so.)

30:11.180 --> 30:12.380
The offer arrived.

30:12.581 --> 30:14.180
You just let him not go.

30:15.981 --> 30:17.420
No further discussion.

30:17.981 --> 30:19.220
Do I not even have the right

30:19.781 --> 30:21.701
to speak about Luzhou?

30:22.220 --> 30:23.661
Because of an accidental incident?

30:24.621 --> 30:25.621
Yes.

30:26.180 --> 30:27.581
I did promise you

30:28.300 --> 30:30.581
to send Luzhou abroad when he turned 18.

30:31.380 --> 30:33.380
But you saw what happened that time.

30:33.380 --> 30:34.901
That young man was covered in blood,

30:34.901 --> 30:36.300
lying in front of us.

30:36.300 --> 30:38.100
He's about the same age as Luzhou.

30:38.821 --> 30:40.060
I can't leave my own son

30:40.060 --> 30:41.340
alone abroad.

30:42.180 --> 30:43.340
Except Ruicheng,

30:43.741 --> 30:45.380
he can go to another country.

30:46.340 --> 30:47.340
Have you

30:48.861 --> 30:50.300
already made up your mind

30:50.701 --> 30:52.420
not to make him to go out at all?

30:54.460 --> 30:55.981
You simply don't trust me.

30:56.821 --> 30:57.861
No matter what I say,

30:59.661 --> 31:00.861
you won't believe it.

31:03.500 --> 31:04.741
Is it that I don't trust you?

31:05.021 --> 31:05.822
From the start,

31:05.822 --> 31:07.140
you lied to me.

31:07.420 --> 31:08.781
How is it my fault then?

31:11.500 --> 31:13.300
This happened more than a decade ago.

31:13.500 --> 31:14.661
You're bringing up the past?

31:14.781 --> 31:15.901
I can stop bringing up past,

31:16.260 --> 31:17.260
but please

31:17.541 --> 31:18.781
fulfill your promise.

31:19.060 --> 31:20.220
I can't fulfill it.

31:20.821 --> 31:22.981
If you insist on forcing Luzhou abroad,

31:25.300 --> 31:26.380
we'll get a divorce.

31:30.260 --> 31:31.380
You want to divorce me?

31:36.220 --> 31:37.701
You better not regret it.

31:50.180 --> 31:51.180
I understand.

31:53.621 --> 31:55.021
So you two

31:55.781 --> 31:57.060
have already discussed this.

31:58.941 --> 32:00.781
I'm the only one left in the dark.

32:03.500 --> 32:04.500
Divorce.

32:06.821 --> 32:07.861
Fine then, divorce it is!

33:05.376 --> 33:06.100
(Friend Reuqest)

33:06.100 --> 33:07.100
(I'm Jiang Yu.)

33:07.541 --> 33:09.621
(Don't lose important things again
next time.)

33:13.981 --> 33:15.781
It's okay. Just a small wound.

33:30.821 --> 33:31.821
Otherwise, tonight,

33:32.581 --> 33:34.060
you go sleep in Xingqi's room.

33:34.981 --> 33:35.981
I'll stay with him.

33:46.180 --> 33:47.180
Are you okay?

33:53.300 --> 33:55.460
Even if I explain many things to you,

33:56.380 --> 33:57.821
you may not necessarily understand.

33:58.300 --> 34:00.941
You will definitely look at us
from your perspective.

34:03.180 --> 34:04.420
All would do so.

34:05.500 --> 34:06.661
We are not the same.

34:09.541 --> 34:10.781
I feel that in this world,

34:10.781 --> 34:12.621
there is no such thing as empathy.

34:14.100 --> 34:15.380
Because there is no one

34:15.380 --> 34:17.140
who can truly understand one another.

34:19.701 --> 34:21.300
Don't make things so complicated.

34:22.661 --> 34:23.661
Have you ever thought

34:24.260 --> 34:25.861
if I leave this family,

34:25.861 --> 34:27.220
there wouldn't be many problems.

34:27.220 --> 34:28.460
Don't think like that.

34:30.420 --> 34:32.300
This matter has nothing to do with you.

34:33.021 --> 34:35.220
It's an issue between
Chen Jishen and me.

34:36.220 --> 34:38.060
Adults will handle adult matters.

34:45.300 --> 34:46.781
But I am also an adult now.

34:48.460 --> 34:49.901
From now on,

34:50.781 --> 34:51.781
about the future,

34:53.340 --> 34:54.340
I'll decide my future.

35:01.048 --> 35:02.460
Go to sleep.

35:03.260 --> 35:04.260
Luzhou.

35:07.220 --> 35:08.901
Are mom and dad really going to divorce?

35:12.021 --> 35:13.500
Who will you stay with then?

35:16.300 --> 35:17.300
I won't stay with anyone.

35:18.661 --> 35:19.861
Then can I stay with you?

35:25.941 --> 35:26.941
Go to sleep.

35:41.688 --> 35:45.302
♪On a midsummer night♪

35:45.688 --> 35:50.296
♪The streetlights gradually awaken♪

35:52.088 --> 35:55.877
♪The moonlight
penetrates the tree shades♪

35:56.024 --> 36:00.906
♪Chasing the distance
between you and me♪

36:02.296 --> 36:04.870
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

36:04.870 --> 36:12.504
(Quotes from a liar:
I will always be by your side.)

36:13.144 --> 36:16.157
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

36:17.912 --> 36:20.222
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

36:21.464 --> 36:32.472
(Quotes from a liar:
I will always be by your side.)

36:36.696 --> 36:42.168
♪Ah, ah, ah♪

36:42.168 --> 36:44.856
♪Ah, ah, ah♪

36:51.140 --> 36:52.340
Xu Zhi, over there.

36:52.340 --> 36:53.380
Okay.

36:53.380 --> 36:54.541
Junior, help Xu Zhi.

36:54.861 --> 36:55.380
Come with me.

36:55.380 --> 36:56.380
Okay.

36:58.380 --> 36:59.380
Thank you.

37:02.581 --> 37:03.901
Do you need any help?

37:04.741 --> 37:06.861
I can manage on my own. Thank you.

37:10.581 --> 37:11.581
Well.

37:11.981 --> 37:13.420
As a newbie in publicity department,

37:13.941 --> 37:14.941
feel free to ask me

37:15.021 --> 37:16.021
if anything's unclear.

37:16.536 --> 37:17.272
Okay.

37:23.140 --> 37:24.141
Senior,

37:24.141 --> 37:25.500
how should we stick it here?

37:25.741 --> 37:27.021
I still need to help over there.

37:27.701 --> 37:28.701
Okay.

37:34.741 --> 37:36.941
Then where should I stick this one?

37:40.021 --> 37:42.060
Senior.

37:42.180 --> 37:43.460
Senior, focus a bit.

37:43.621 --> 37:44.621
Thank you.

37:49.941 --> 37:51.220
Hey, Miss Cai,

37:51.420 --> 37:53.100
you finally have time to care about me.

37:53.661 --> 37:55.541
I started school.

37:55.941 --> 37:58.180
I can't contact you freely, okay?

37:58.981 --> 37:59.981
How have you been?

38:00.300 --> 38:02.941
Did you meet the alternative
Chen Luzhou?

38:03.701 --> 38:05.140
I'm not that free.

38:05.981 --> 38:07.021
At our second canteen,

38:07.021 --> 38:08.621
there's a delicious malatang.

38:09.140 --> 38:10.901
For just over 10 yuan,
you get a full bowl.

38:12.021 --> 38:13.180
Really?

38:13.621 --> 38:15.821
Are you trying to tempt me
to go to Beijing?

38:15.821 --> 38:16.861
You should come quickly.

38:17.220 --> 38:18.340
If you're late,

38:18.701 --> 38:20.220
this title of my bestie

38:20.220 --> 38:21.220
will belong to others.

38:21.581 --> 38:22.581
How dare you!

38:23.100 --> 38:24.981
How has your relationship
with your dad been?

38:25.380 --> 38:26.380
(Join the Chemistry Experiment Club)
To be honest,

38:26.581 --> 38:27.661
I think

38:28.021 --> 38:30.701
since I'm repeating my studies,
I can spend an extra year with him.

38:31.021 --> 38:32.021
It's quite good.

38:32.861 --> 38:34.060
You figured it out so quickly?

38:34.941 --> 38:36.220
Because that day,

38:36.541 --> 38:37.821
I went to the hospital.

38:39.140 --> 38:40.340
Come on. Let's drink.

38:45.901 --> 38:46.500
Mr. Cai,

38:46.821 --> 38:48.260
where did Yingying end up going?

38:50.781 --> 38:52.340
She didn't do well on the exam.

38:52.340 --> 38:54.021
She's at home, repeating her studies.

38:54.661 --> 38:56.021
Repeating studies is so tough.

38:56.380 --> 38:57.380
There's no need for this.

38:57.701 --> 38:58.582
For girls,

38:58.582 --> 38:59.608
it's all the same.

39:00.220 --> 39:02.460
Education just sounds good in theory.

39:02.460 --> 39:03.621
A good husband

39:03.621 --> 39:04.440
matters most, right?

39:04.440 --> 39:05.822
Don't say that.

39:05.822 --> 39:07.781
How can a girl's education
not be important?

39:08.420 --> 39:09.821
(Cai Binhong, Vice Dean)
In the past,

39:10.021 --> 39:11.100
I was too busy with work

39:11.100 --> 39:12.621
to look after her when she was young.

39:14.340 --> 39:15.340
Never mind.

39:15.420 --> 39:17.701
She is not worse than others.

39:18.100 --> 39:19.180
And she's intelligent.

39:19.420 --> 39:20.180
If she works hard,

39:20.340 --> 39:22.621
she can get into the university
she likes.

39:23.581 --> 39:24.581
Moreover, I feel

39:25.140 --> 39:27.420
her future marriage quality
isn't important.

39:28.460 --> 39:30.420
What matters is her happiness.

39:30.420 --> 39:31.060
Isn't it?

39:31.340 --> 39:31.862
Yes.

39:31.862 --> 39:33.220
It's okay to stay single.

39:33.380 --> 39:34.581
That's what I think.

39:35.180 --> 39:37.500
If she does well in the next exam,

39:37.861 --> 39:38.861
she will support me.

39:39.140 --> 39:40.380
In case she doesn't do well,

39:41.380 --> 39:42.500
I will support her for life.

39:43.661 --> 39:44.701
Have some tea.

39:44.701 --> 39:45.701
Okay, come on.

39:52.821 --> 39:53.782
Hearing you say that,

39:53.782 --> 39:55.180
I kind of miss Xu.

39:56.220 --> 39:57.260
Don't worry.

39:57.260 --> 39:58.741
Your dad's cooking is so good.

39:58.741 --> 40:00.941
I'll often go to your house
for a meal on your behalf.

40:01.861 --> 40:04.621
Alright, I won't talk to you for now.

40:04.621 --> 40:05.741
My tasks aren't finished.

40:06.340 --> 40:07.861
Bye-bye.

40:08.140 --> 40:09.140
Bye-bye.

40:26.581 --> 40:27.581
Are you okay?

40:27.901 --> 40:30.021
It's nothing. Just a slight sprain.
It's not serious.

40:52.760 --> 40:53.821
From the dorm lady.

40:53.941 --> 40:54.941
Who bought them?

40:55.460 --> 40:56.460
She has no idea.

41:09.100 --> 41:09.702
(When he)

41:09.702 --> 41:11.581
(took me to the practice track,)

41:11.861 --> 41:12.421
I didn't get

41:12.421 --> 41:13.541
the apexing right

41:13.541 --> 41:14.861
and crashed.

41:14.981 --> 41:16.300
Luckily, it was not serious.

41:17.420 --> 41:19.300
But I scraped my knee

41:20.060 --> 41:21.140
and got arthritis.

41:21.821 --> 41:23.460
It hurts on rainy days.

41:23.460 --> 41:24.741
It even creaks.

41:25.260 --> 41:26.941
That's why I hate going out
on rainy days.

41:27.901 --> 41:28.901
You listen.

41:31.901 --> 41:32.901
Chen Luzhou.

41:34.008 --> 41:36.598
♪And you always have me♪

41:37.016 --> 41:38.840
♪Don't be afraid,
what you've experienced♪

41:39.000 --> 41:41.021
Where are you going?

41:41.912 --> 41:43.672
♪You will fulfill the past♪

41:43.672 --> 41:45.688
♪Dream you long for♪

41:45.688 --> 41:49.240
♪Open your arms to embrace the breeze♪

41:49.368 --> 41:53.033
♪Together with you♪

41:53.033 --> 41:54.488
♪Look, this city♪

41:54.488 --> 41:57.277
♪It keeps raining♪

41:57.277 --> 41:59.608
♪Ticking and tattling♪

41:59.608 --> 42:01.528
♪Who is worried♪

42:01.528 --> 42:05.078
♪I believe
you can't find a reason either♪

42:05.208 --> 42:08.671
♪Don't give it an answer♪

42:09.208 --> 42:11.448
♪I'm the same♪

42:12.408 --> 42:15.544
♪Just keep moving forward♪

42:16.376 --> 42:19.128
♪Memories fade♪

42:19.768 --> 42:23.416
♪Yet we are still♪

42:23.928 --> 42:28.065
♪For ages♪

43:17.581 --> 43:19.220
(Shy Boy Chen: Just woke up. What's up?)

43:23.581 --> 43:26.260
(Did you bring me medicine?)

43:27.220 --> 43:29.420
(Li Ke: Xu Zhi, did you receive
the medicine for you?)

43:33.781 --> 43:34.861
(I received it.)

43:35.220 --> 43:36.821
(How did you know I was injured?)

43:37.180 --> 43:39.260
(I have informants, you know.)

43:40.380 --> 43:41.460
(I'm really sorry.)

43:41.781 --> 43:42.542
(I don't know it.)

43:42.542 --> 43:43.901
(So I just bought randomly.)

43:44.100 --> 43:46.060
(For sprains, joint pain,
calcium supplements,)

43:46.060 --> 43:46.741
(I got them all.)

43:46.861 --> 43:47.581
(Pick)

43:47.661 --> 43:48.861
(a useful one.)

43:50.581 --> 43:51.581
(Thanks a lot.)

43:52.661 --> 43:53.500
(You're welcome.)

43:53.581 --> 43:54.661
(We're fellow villagers.)

43:54.661 --> 43:56.180
(You are a friend of Luzhou.)

43:56.180 --> 43:57.180
(My duty.)

43:59.300 --> 44:00.460
(Impossible.)

44:01.100 --> 44:02.541
(Chen Luzhou is in Ruicheng.)

44:02.901 --> 44:04.621
(How could he possibly
appear in Beijing?)

44:40.021 --> 44:41.541
(Nothing. I hit the wrong key.)

45:12.888 --> 45:15.000
(Zhi)

45:39.661 --> 45:41.661
(Done. There shouldn't
be any loopholes.)

45:51.340 --> 45:52.340
Thanks.

45:52.661 --> 45:53.821
Why so polite with me?

45:54.180 --> 45:56.100
I just didn't expect you

45:56.100 --> 45:57.861
act like a coward,

45:58.220 --> 45:59.981
sending medicine under my name.

46:00.380 --> 46:01.380
In my opinion,

46:01.500 --> 46:02.341
if you really like,

46:02.341 --> 46:03.621
just go for her boldly.

46:03.981 --> 46:05.500
The far-away love isn't unusual.

46:05.901 --> 46:07.140
You have me as a lookout.

46:09.300 --> 46:10.300
I'm busy.

46:10.621 --> 46:11.701
Talk later. Bye.

46:59.518 --> 47:01.408
(Fighting alone for so many years.
What I want might be a bit greedier.)

47:01.408 --> 47:03.320
(It's passionate and unfaltering love.
It's one of a kind. It must be me.)

47:03.704 --> 47:09.520
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

47:10.072 --> 47:15.600
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

47:17.112 --> 47:21.560
♪The world is too quiet♪

47:22.552 --> 47:29.480
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

47:30.392 --> 47:35.480
♪Who will visit me♪

47:36.536 --> 47:42.160
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

47:42.904 --> 47:45.960
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

47:46.200 --> 47:51.520
♪Into concern and care♪

47:57.048 --> 48:02.160
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

48:02.680 --> 48:08.520
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

48:09.976 --> 48:13.360
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

48:13.496 --> 48:19.720
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

48:20.216 --> 48:23.160
♪The lonely clock♪

48:23.320 --> 48:27.920
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

48:28.312 --> 48:31.560
♪Are we both♪

48:31.832 --> 48:35.360
♪Attracted to each other♪

48:36.504 --> 48:43.120
♪Falling into you♪

48:46.840 --> 48:52.640
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

48:53.496 --> 48:56.160
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

48:56.696 --> 49:01.320
♪From reaching eternity♪

49:01.720 --> 49:05.000
♪After rushing recklessly♪

49:05.208 --> 49:08.640
♪We approach each other♪

49:09.912 --> 49:13.520
♪Without turning back♪

49:14.904 --> 49:22.560
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

49:23.192 --> 49:29.680
♪Falling into you♪
